    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hello and Welcome!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snapshot Aquarium is an aquarium simulator / shooter hybrid where you unlock new content by shooting pictures of fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features implemented so far:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade-style photo challenges</strong> <br>    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>easy</strong>:  non-frustrating, with auto-aim, focus is not needed<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>regular</strong>: with auto-aiming<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>hardcore</strong>: manual aiming, manual focus <br><br>    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aquarium Editing</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">design beautiful habitats for your fish, as seen in the gameplay video </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> more than 300 items are included already, more will be added after release</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Community</strong>\u00a0Challenges </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit and accomplish challenges in other player's aquariums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your own aquariums and get visitors from all over the world! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic Fish AI</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Schooling, fleeing, feeding, growing in near-realtime  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aggressive fish chase others </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features we hope to add:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic fish needs and happiness (certain plants, school size, ...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More creative options (aquascaping)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Community photo quests (find the fish!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic fish AI and animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... ? (Suggestions are welcome! We love working on this and don't plan to stop anytime soon)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you enjoy the game already, feedback and suggestions are highly appreciated! <br> <br>Love, peace and cheers,  <br>Team Octoponx</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hello and Welcome!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snapshot Aquarium is an aquarium simulator / shooter hybrid where you unlock new content by shooting pictures of fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features implemented so far:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade-style photo challenges</strong> <br>    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>easy</strong>:  non-frustrating, with auto-aim, focus is not needed<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>regular</strong>: with auto-aiming<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>hardcore</strong>: manual aiming, manual focus <br><br>    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aquarium Editing</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">design beautiful habitats for your fish, as seen in the gameplay video </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> more than 300 items are included already, more will be added after release</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Community</strong>\u00a0Challenges </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit and accomplish challenges in other player's aquariums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your own aquariums and get visitors from all over the world! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic Fish AI</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Schooling, fleeing, feeding, growing in near-realtime  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aggressive fish chase others </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features we hope to add:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic fish needs and happiness (certain plants, school size, ...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More creative options (aquascaping)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Community photo quests (find the fish!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic fish AI and animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... ? (Suggestions are welcome! We love working on this and don't plan to stop anytime soon)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you enjoy the game already, feedback and suggestions are highly appreciated! <br> <br>Love, peace and cheers,  <br>Team Octoponx</p>",
